{"seq":2,"slug":"techniques","title":"隐私增强技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"differential-privacy","title":"差分隐私的工程实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/techniques/differential-privacy","wordCount":1775,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"federated-learning","title":"联邦学习架构与部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/techniques/federated-learning","wordCount":2013,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"privacy-enhancing-technologies","title":"隐私增强技术全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/techniques/privacy-enhancing-technologies","wordCount":1756,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"隐私增强技术\">隐私增强技术</h1><p>本章深入三大核心隐私增强技术（Privacy-Enhancing Technologies, PETs）的工程实现。差分隐私提供数学可证明的隐私保证，联邦学习让多方协作训练模型而不共享原始数据，同态加密与安全多方计算等高级 PETs 则在更广泛的场景中实现&quot;数据可用不可见&quot;。</p>\n<p>这些技术不是学术论文中的理论构造——Apple、Google、Meta 等公司已在生产环境中大规模部署。本章聚焦于从理论到工程落地的关键桥梁：噪声预算管理、通信效率优化、以及精度与隐私的权衡决策框架。</p>\n"}